WEBVTT - Bodyweight Lunge Guidance

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Stand tall with your feet hip-width apart and your hands on your hips.

00:04.000 --> 00:09.000
Take a controlled step forward, lowering your hips until both knees reach ninety degrees.

00:09.000 --> 00:14.000
Keep your front knee aligned directly above your ankle without shooting past toes.

00:14.000 --> 00:19.000
Push firmly through your front heel to return smoothly to the starting stance.

00:19.000 --> 00:25.000
Keep your upper torso upright and engage your core for balanced symmetry.

